Subject: Keep two r2 vendoring artifacts
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [no effect on the build]
Drop-when: phase 2; exists only so the phase-1 tree is byte-identical to r2

Vendoring the driver into this repository narrowed .gitignore from
manager/ to /manager/ so kernel/manager/ could be tracked, and an
editor removed one trailing space in apk_sign.c.
---
diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index 57d95633b1403ff0e2e4ab424300d3c1d92e89f9..de6c978d2f4be3a59ff1883fbbfdb6d2205f6847 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -1 +1 @@
-manager/
\ No newline at end of file
+/manager/
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/kernel/manager/apk_sign.c b/kernel/manager/apk_sign.c
index 006af81a82911289e06f7bbd9de801ce4ebe263e..6342dc70fb8ac82f85b1bf7e9145de742765524d 100644
--- a/kernel/manager/apk_sign.c
+++ b/kernel/manager/apk_sign.c
@@ -357,7 +357,7 @@ bool is_manager_apk(char *path)
 
     for (i = 0; i < ARRAY_SIZE(apk_sign_keys); i++) {
         if (check_v2_signature(path, apk_sign_keys[i].size, apk_sign_keys[i].sha256)) {
-            pr_info("Manager APK verified with key: %s (size: 0x%x)\n", 
+            pr_info("Manager APK verified with key: %s (size: 0x%x)\n",
                     apk_sign_keys[i].sha256, apk_sign_keys[i].size);
             return true;
         }
